 /gold-gbm-3-ymblt\n\nDescription:\nGraduate student (workers): partake in 
 collective decision-making at GOLD's next General Body Meeting (GBM)! Thes
 e meetings are the highest governing body of our union\, and all members a
 re welcome and called to participate. At GBMs\, we keep each other informe
 d about important issues and plan the future direction of our union. Food 
 (typically pizza) and drinks are always served 🍕🧃. For more details 
 on each meeting\, including the agenda and the on-campus meeting location\
 , check your Dartmouth email for messages from GOLD-UE. Click the link to 
 view more details.\n\nSource: Dartmouth GSC\n\nWhy this was included: food
